msgid "Visibility of the Participant List"
msgstr ""

#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/event/event/change_event.tmpl:80
msgid ""
"If checked, a participant list containg name, email, postal code and city is "
"shown to all participants. Also, if the lodge field is set (see below) and "
"part of the Questionnaire, people will be shown a list of successfully "
"detected lodgement wishes."
msgstr ""

#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/event/event/change_event.tmpl:85
msgid ""
"If checked, the course assignment is shown to the participants. In "
"particular, it is shown to each participant on the registration status and "
"on the Participant List. Additionally, instructors will be able to see their "
"assigned attendees, even if the participant list isn't visible."
msgstr ""

