msgid "Cancellation of the event"
msgstr ""

#: cdedb/frontend/templates/web/event/event/change_event.tmpl:91
msgid ""
"If checked, the event is shown as cancelled. This can be undone and allows "
"the event to be archived. There are no further effects. Do not do this "
"without consulting the chairmen of the CdE."
msgstr ""

